  "ingredients": [
    "2 (4 ounce) lobster tails",
    "4 tablespoons butter",
    "1 teaspoon lemon zest",
    "1 clove garlic, grated",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste",
    "1 teaspoon chopped fresh parsley",
    "2 wedges lemon"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat an air fryer to 380 degrees F (195 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/I5b2uOR0Jpf2goZ1biY-PKBQ-IU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-276006-air-fryer-lobster-tails-with-lemon-garlic-butter-DDMFS-step-01-1-2b6070430b5a45f3be60f54e51dfa60f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276006/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Butterfly lobster tails by cutting lengthwise through the centers of the hard top shells and meat with kitchen shears. Cut to, but not through, the bottoms of the shells.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jsbmcp2434yBDgtd2iZaK9RKLo0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-276006-air-fryer-lobster-tails-with-lemon-garlic-butter-DDMFS-step-02-48a5db99792b43d29166c2a82c92994e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276006/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread tail halves apart. Place tails in the air fryer basket with lobster meat facing up.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/r2PzlR-yQP_2hs8jr3bOspR0gdA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-276006-air-fryer-lobster-tails-with-lemon-garlic-butter-DDMFS-step-04-905639a1246a406cbdb10541c0f59afb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276006/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a small saucepan over medium heat. Add lemon zest and garlic; heat until garlic is fragrant, about 30 seconds.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-6eUme0qs9GmvoRH7bDahr1jMsQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-276006-air-fryer-lobster-tails-with-lemon-garlic-butter-DDMFS-step-05-5fa3a6f47c4a4d10bf8ad78f80ceb04f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276006/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer 2 tablespoons of butter mixture to a small bowl; brush this onto lobster tails. Discard any remaining brushed butter to avoid contamination from uncooked lobster. Season lobster with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TRPPOPMVIHw88UK-RvpFdNs1V3k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-276006-air-fryer-lobster-tails-with-lemon-garlic-butter-DDMFS-step-06-ce5ac45f08264f0f81e7e51c01757f79.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276006/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook in the preheated air fryer until lobster meat is opaque, 5 to 7 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Umu1Vwnzjj0Jr3R-nI-hyw754Qk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-276006-air-fryer-lobster-tails-with-lemon-garlic-butter-DDMFS-step-07-9741d146d08e4e759b0e9d8f5b8117f3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276006/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon reserved butter from the saucepan over lobster meat. Top with parsley and serve with lemon wedges.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QGjYdew8TgeUz3Zr_N706E0RXAo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-276006-air-fryer-lobster-tails-with-lemon-garlic-butter-DDMFS-step-09-46d6da8973b546bda7ebd6fc159b34a1.jpg"
      ],
